---
title: Blog
description: Training, nutrition, and hormone strategy for men 40+ from Coach Boltz. No fluff, no generic programs.
section: blog
layout: base.njk
---
<style>
  .blog-hero{padding:170px 24px 90px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(245,245,243,0.08);}
  .blog-eyebrow{
    display:inline-block;color:var(--orange);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .blog-title{font-size:clamp(32px,6.5vw,54px);line-height:1.1;color:var(--white-pure);margin-bottom:18px;}
  .blog-title span{color:var(--orange);}
  .blog-subtitle{font-size:clamp(15.5px,3.5vw,18px);line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-muted-dark);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;}

  .blog-empty{padding:100px 24px;text-align:center;}
  .blog-empty-inner{max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;}
  .blog-empty-icon{font-size:38px;color:var(--orange);margin-bottom:22px;}
  .blog-empty h2{font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:24px;color:var(--white-pure);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .blog-empty p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-muted-dark);margin-bottom:34px;}

  .post-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:28px;max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:90px 24px;}
  .post-card{
    background:var(--black-soft);border:1px solid rgba(245,245,243,0.08);border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;transition:transform 0.25s ease;display:block;
  }
  .post-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);}
  .post-card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover;}
  .post-card-body{padding:22px 24px 26px;}
  .post-card-date{font-size:12px;color:var(--orange);letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .post-card h3{font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:19px;line-height:1.25;color:var(--white-pure);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .post-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text-muted-dark);}
  @media (max-width:700px){ .post-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:480px;} }
</style>

<section class="blog-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="blog-eyebrow">The Boltz Performance Blog</span>
    <h1 class="blog-title display">Training, Nutrition, And <span>No-BS Coaching Advice</span></h1>
    <p class="blog-subtitle">Straight talk for men 40+ who want their body to keep up with everything else they're building. New posts land here first.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if collections.posts.length > 0 %}
<div class="post-grid">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
    {% if post.data.image %}<img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
    <div class="post-card-body">
      <div class="post-card-date">{{ post.data.date | date("MMMM D, YYYY") }}</div>
      <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
    </div>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<section class="blog-empty">
  <div class="blog-empty-inner">
    <div class="blog-empty-icon">&#9679;&#9679;&#9679;</div>
    <h2>First Post Is Coming</h2>
    <p>Nothing published here yet — this page is live and ready. The first breakdown drops soon. In the meantime, book a call and skip the line.</p>
    <a href="https://calendly.com/coach-ihp/1-1consult" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">Book Your Strategy Call</a>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
